(1. Authentication) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
0 -10 Td
T*
T*
(Every request to the Orbit API must carry an API key in the Orbit-Key header. Requests) Tj
T*
(without a key, or with a revoked key, are answered with 401 Unauthorized.) Tj
T*
T*
(There are two kinds of keys. Live keys start with orb_live_ and move real money. Test) Tj
T*
(keys start with orb_test_ and only work against the sandbox at sandbox.orbit.example.) Tj
T*
(Never use a live key in a test environment or in client-side code.) Tj
T*
T*
(Keys must be rotated at least every 90 days. When you create a new key, the old one) Tj
T*
(keeps working for a 24-hour grace period, so you can deploy the new key without) Tj
T*
(downtime. A key that leaked must be revoked immediately from the dashboard.) Tj
ET
