(3. Webhooks) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
0 -10 Td
T*
T*
(Orbit sends webhook events \(payment.succeeded, payment.failed, refund.created\) to the) Tj
T*
(HTTPS endpoint you register. Each event is signed with HMAC-SHA256 using your webhook) Tj
T*
(secret, and the signature is sent in the Orbit-Signature header. Always verify it before) Tj
T*
(trusting the event.) Tj
T*
T*
(Your endpoint must answer with a 2xx status within 10 seconds. Otherwise the delivery) Tj
T*
(counts as failed and Orbit retries it up to 8 times over 24 hours, with exponential) Tj
T*
(backoff. After the last attempt the event is marked as undelivered and shown in the) Tj
T*
(dashboard.) Tj
T*
T*
(Events can arrive more than once and out of order. Use the event id to ignore) Tj
T*
(duplicates.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
290 40 Td
(Page 3) Tj
ET
