(4. Errors and idempotency) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
0 -10 Td
T*
T*
(Errors return a JSON body with a stable code. The most common codes are: ORB-4471, the) Tj
T*
(card was declined for insufficient funds; ORB-4012, the card has expired; ORB-5003, the) Tj
T*
(upstream card processor timed out. Codes starting with ORB-5 are temporary and can be) Tj
T*
(retried.) Tj
T*
T*
(To retry a payment safely, send an Idempotency-Key header with a unique value. Orbit) Tj
T*
(stores the result of the first request for 24 hours and returns the same result for) Tj
T*
(every retry with the same key, so a customer is never charged twice.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
