(6. Payouts) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
15 TL
0 -10 Td
T*
T*
(Orbit pays out your available balance to your bank account every business day. Funds) Tj
T*
(from a payment become available two business days after it succeeds, so a payment made) Tj
T*
(on Monday is paid out on Wednesday.) Tj
T*
T*
(Payouts below 20 EUR are held and added to the next payout. You can pause payouts from) Tj
T*
(the dashboard, for example while you change bank accounts; paused funds stay safe in) Tj
T*
(your Orbit balance.) Tj
