15 TL
0 -10 Td
T*
T*
(When a customer disputes a payment with their bank \(a chargeback\), Orbit notifies you) Tj
T*
(with a dispute.created event and immediately holds the disputed amount plus a 15 USD) Tj
T*
(dispute fee.) Tj
T*
T*
(You have 7 days to respond with evidence such as receipts, delivery tracking or the) Tj
T*
(customer's messages. The bank then decides, which can take up to 75 days. If you win,) Tj
T*
(the amount and the fee are returned; if you lose or do not respond, both are kept.) Tj
